---
layout: null
---
{%- comment -%}
Manifest aller einbettbaren Dokumente (SPEC-007). Wird vom WordPress-Plugin gelesen,
um im Editor eine Auswahlliste anzubieten. Ausschluss einzelner Seiten ueber
`manifest: false` im Front Matter.

Wird per `cp -n` von der Reusable Workflow in die Kind-Repos uebernommen; die Inhalte
entstehen dort aus den jeweils eigenen Seiten.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign listed = "" | split: "" -%}
{%- for p in site.pages -%}
  {%- if p.title and p.url != "/docs.json" and p.manifest != false -%}
    {%- assign listed = listed | push: p -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{
  "generated": "{{ site.time | date_to_xmlschema }}",
  "site": {{ site.title | jsonify }},
  "documents": [
{%- for p in listed %}
    {
      "slug": "{% assign s = p.url | split: '/' | last | replace: '.html', '' | replace: '.md', '' %}{{ s | default: 'index' }}",
      "title": {{ p.title | jsonify }},
      "subtitle": {{ p.subtitle | default: "" | jsonify }},
      "url": "{{ p.url | relative_url }}",
      "pdf": {{ p.pdf | default: "" | jsonify }},
      "source": {{ p.source | default: "" | jsonify }},
      "template": "{{ p.template | default: site.template | default: 'base' }}",
      "section_numbering": {{ p.section_numbering | default: "" | jsonify }},
      "lang": "{{ p.lang | default: site.lang | default: 'de' }}",
      "home": {% if p.url == "/" or p.url == "/index.html" %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor %}
  ]
}
